        <p><b>Date :</b> 15 - 16 September 2026</p>
        <p><b>Venue :</b> ABC College Auditorium</p>
        <p><b>Organized by :</b> Department of Computer Science</p>

        <h2 align="left">Events</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Coding Challenge</li>
            <li>Hackathon</li>
            <li>AI Quiz</li>
            <li>Robotics</li>
            <li>Web Design Competition</li>
        </ul>

    </div>

    <div class="right">
        <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/250x250?text=TECHFEST+2026">
